Betweenness axioms II.1 to II.4, taken as primitive on a line.\
\>", "TableText",ExpressionUUID->"b8339ced-98e2-4814-8a11-e3c677377250"]},
   {Cell["      ", "ModInfo",ExpressionUUID->
